#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A Rust compiler: see for example the [guide on installing Qiskit from source](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md#installing-qiskit-from-source)\n"
msgstr "Rust compiler: ดูตัวอย่างเช่น [คู่มือการติดตั้ง Qiskit จาก source](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md#installing-qiskit-from-source)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
